{"ts": "2026-11-17T13:48:02+00:00", "run": "20261117T191328", "ticket": "T015", "outcome": "posted", "action": "reply", "language": "nl", "category": "question", "priority": "P4", "confidence": 0.98, "faq_ids": ["F04", "F05"], "model_action": "reply", "hard_rules": [], "escalated_because": [], "reply_en": "Hi,\n\nYes, Roosterly can export the approved hours to Loket.nl, but this functionality is part of our Plus plan. To set up the export, you first need to upgrade to Plus. Go to Settings → Subscription and choose the Plus plan; the new price applies from the next invoice.\n\nAfter the upgrade you can activate the integration via Settings → Integrations → Payroll and select Loket.nl there. The export is performed per pay period (week, four weeks, or month).\n\nKind regards,\nTeam Roosterly", "redacted": [], "seconds": 36.22}
